@page "/markets/industrial-iot"
@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Industrial & IoT Electronics Manufacturing — Hana Microelectronics";
    ViewData["Description"] = "Hana manufactures industrial and IoT electronics — ruggedised PCBA and box build, connected device assembly, RFID asset tracking and power modules — across Thailand and China.";
}
@section Head {
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="~/css/market-page.css" />
}
@section Scripts {
    <script src="~/js/market-sidebar.js"></script>
}

<div class="mk-crumbbar"><div class="mk-wrap in"><a href="/markets">Markets</a><span class="sep">&rsaquo;</span><span class="here">Industrial &amp; IoT</span></div></div><section class="mk-hero" data-hana-bg="flow" data-variant="light" data-fade="none"><div class="mk-wrap mk-hero-in"><div><div class="mk-eyebrow">Markets we serve</div><h1 class="mk-h1">Industrial and IoT electronics manufacturing</h1><p class="mk-lede">Controllers, connected devices and power electronics for industrial equipment, manufactured for demanding operating environments and long product lifecycles. Hana provides PCBA, ruggedized assembly and complete product build, with manufacturing across multiple sites for supply continuity.</p><div class="mk-btns"><a href="/contact" class="hana-btn hana-btn-primary" style="padding:12px 22px;font-size:12px;">Talk to us <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:14px;height:14px;margin-left:6px;"></i></a><a href="#products" class="hana-btn hana-btn-secondary" style="padding:12px 22px;font-size:12px;">Product examples</a></div></div><div class="mk-hero-media"><img src="~/images/photos/mk-industrial-iot-hero.webp" alt="Industrial sensor and controller assembly on the production floor" /></div></div><div class="mk-wrap" style="position:relative;z-index:1;padding-bottom:52px;"><div class="mk-strip"><span class="hana-spec-label" style="flex-shrink:0;">Product examples</span><div class="mk-chips"><span>Environmental monitors</span><span>Meters</span><span>Controllers</span><span>Connected sensors</span><span>Label printers</span><span>Drone sensors</span></div></div></div></section><section class="mk-dark"><div class="mk-wrap in"><div style="max-width:760px;margin-bottom:34px;"><div class="mk-eyebrow on-dark">Why industrial buyers choose Hana</div><h2 class="mk-h2 on-dark">Ruggedized manufacturing for long product lifecycles</h2><p class="mk-body on-dark" style="margin:14px 0 0;">Industrial and IoT products operate in cabinets, production environments and outdoor enclosures, often over long product lifecycles. Hana supports these programs with conformal and parylene coating, mixed-technology assembly, controlled change management and obsolescence support. Qualified manufacturing processes are available across multiple Hana sites to provide additional supply continuity where required.</p></div><div class="mk-points"><div class="pt"><div class="t">Ruggedized build</div><p>Conformal coating, mixed-technology assembly and through-hole processes for products exposed to heat, vibration, moisture and mechanical loading.</p></div><div class="pt"><div class="t">Long-program support</div><p>Controlled change management and obsolescence support for industrial programs that remain in production over extended product lifecycles.</p></div><div class="pt"><div class="t">Multi-site manufacturing</div><p>Qualified processes across Hana sites in Thailand and China provide additional manufacturing capacity and supply-continuity options within the group.</p></div></div></div></section><section id="products" data-hana-bg="pcb" data-variant="light" data-fade="none" style="background:#fff;border-top:1px solid var(--line);position:relative;overflow:hidden;"><div class="mk-wrap" style="position:relative;z-index:1;padding-top:64px;padding-bottom:60px;"><div style="max-width:700px;margin-bottom:28px;"><h2 class="mk-h2">Product examples</h2></div><div class="mk-cards c3"><a class="mk-card" href="/markets/industrial-iot/pcba-box-build"><div class="mk-ph"><img src="~/images/photos/mk-industrial-iot-card-pcba-box-build.webp" alt="Industrial PCBA and box build" style="width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;display:block;"/></div><div class="body"><div class="t">PCBA &amp; box build</div><p>Ruggedized PCBA through to complete, tested product assembly, including conformal and parylene coating, mixed-technology assembly and functional test for industrial controls and equipment.</p><span class="more">Explore <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:12px;height:12px;"></i></span></div></a><a class="mk-card" href="/markets/industrial-iot/iot-device-assembly"><div class="mk-ph"><div style="position:absolute;top:10px;left:12px;width:18px;height:18px;opacity:.4;z-index:1;"><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="var(--hana-blue)" stroke-width="1.5"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"></circle><path d="M12 3v4M12 17v4M3 12h4M17 12h4"></path></svg></div><span class="cap">[ Connected device on the line &mdash; photography needed ]</span></div><div class="body"><div class="t">IoT device assembly</div><p>Complete connected devices integrating the PCBA, wireless modules, sensors, battery and enclosure, with functional and wireless testing at finished-unit level.</p><span class="more">Explore <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:12px;height:12px;"></i></span></div></a><a class="mk-card" href="/markets/industrial-iot/rfid-asset-tracking"><div class="mk-ph"><img src="~/images/photos/mk-industrial-iot-card-rfid-asset-tag.webp" alt="Industrial UHF RFID asset tags" style="width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;display:block;"/></div><div class="body"><div class="t">RFID asset tracking</div><p>Rugged UHF tags, inlays and on-metal constructions for industrial asset tracking, supported by more than 20 years of Hana RFID manufacturing experience.</p><span class="more">Explore <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:12px;height:12px;"></i></span></div></a></div></div></section><section style="background:var(--hana-blue-tint);border-top:1px solid var(--line);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);"><div class="mk-wrap" style="padding-top:56px;padding-bottom:56px;"><div style="max-width:720px;margin-bottom:24px;"><div class="mk-eyebrow">Footprint</div><h2 class="mk-h2 sm">Where we build</h2><p class="mk-body">Industrial and IoT programs are manufactured across Hana sites in Thailand and China. Programs can be qualified across more than one site where additional manufacturing capacity or supply continuity is required.</p></div><div class="mk-locs"><a class="mk-loc" href="/locations/lamphun"><span class="co"><i data-lucide="map-pin" style="width:13px;height:13px;color:var(--hana-blue);"></i><span class="hana-spec-label">Thailand</span></span><div class="nm">Lamphun</div><div class="note">PCBA</div><span class="cta">View plant <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:12px;height:12px;"></i></span></a><a class="mk-loc" href="/locations/ayutthaya"><span class="co"><i data-lucide="map-pin" style="width:13px;height:13px;color:var(--hana-blue);"></i><span class="hana-spec-label">Thailand</span></span><div class="nm">Ayutthaya</div><div class="note">OSAT</div><span class="cta">View plant <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:12px;height:12px;"></i></span></a><a class="mk-loc" href="/locations/jiaxing"><span class="co"><i data-lucide="map-pin" style="width:13px;height:13px;color:var(--hana-blue);"></i><span class="hana-spec-label">China</span></span><div class="nm">Jiaxing</div><div class="note">EMS</div><span class="cta">View plant <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:12px;height:12px;"></i></span></a></div></div></section><section style="background:#fff;"><div class="mk-wrap" style="padding-top:56px;padding-bottom:60px;"><div style="max-width:700px;margin-bottom:22px;"><div class="mk-eyebrow">FAQ</div><h2 class="mk-h2 sm">Frequently asked questions</h2><p class="mk-body">Industrial and IoT — frequently asked. Common questions from industrial and IoT engineering and procurement teams.</p></div><div style="max-width:860px;"><details class="mk-faq" open><summary><span class="mk-faq-mk"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></span><span style="flex:1;">What does Hana build for industrial and IoT?</span></summary><p class="mk-faq-a">Hana manufactures ruggedized PCBAs and complete box-build products, connected IoT devices, and RFID asset-tracking tags. Depending on the program, our scope can extend from board assembly through to complete tested product assembly.</p></details><details class="mk-faq"><summary><span class="mk-faq-mk"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></span><span style="flex:1;">How does Hana support long-running industrial programs?</span></summary><p class="mk-faq-a">Hana supports long-running industrial programs through controlled change management, component obsolescence support and documented manufacturing processes. Ruggedization options including conformal and parylene coating are available where required by the product environment.</p></details><details class="mk-faq"><summary><span class="mk-faq-mk"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></span><span style="flex:1;">Which sites serve industrial programs?</span></summary><p class="mk-faq-a">Industrial manufacturing is available across Hana sites in Thailand and China. Programs can also be qualified across multiple sites where additional capacity or supply continuity is required.</p></details><details class="mk-faq"><summary><span class="mk-faq-mk"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></span><span style="flex:1;">What ruggedized finishing can Hana apply?</span></summary><p class="mk-faq-a">Conformal and parylene coating and harsh-environment finishing are available within our industrial box-build scope. The finish set is selected per program and confirmed per site during the program review.</p></details></div></div></section><section class="mk-cta" data-hana-bg="flow" data-variant="dark" data-fade="none"><div class="mk-wrap in"><div><h2 class="mk-h2 on-dark" style="max-width:520px;">Start an Industrial electronics build program with Hana</h2><p class="mk-body on-dark" style="font-size:16px;max-width:480px;">Tell us what the product does and where it runs. We will point you to the right site and processes, and come back with a plan.</p></div><div class="acts"><a href="/contact" class="hana-btn hana-btn-on-dark" style="padding:12px 22px;font-size:12px;">Contact us <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:14px;height:14px;margin-left:6px;"></i></a></div></div></section>